  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat air fryer to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Cut cauliflower into florets and pulse in food processor until slightly crumbly.",
    "3. In a large bowl, mix together cauliflower, peruvian crumble, garlic, fryer oil, air-fried seasoning, salt, and black pepper.",
    "4. Transfer cauliflower mixture to air fryer basket.",
    "5. Cook for 10-12 minutes, shaking halfway through.",
    "6. Remove from air fryer and serve hot."
